Id: netw044f
Severity: FAIL
Category: network
Check: check_ntp
Fix: Replace broadcastclient and manycastclient with server lines.
References: ntp.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 8.4; NIST AU-8, SC-45; ISO 8.17

The NTP daemon is configured as a broadcast, manycast or multicast
client, so it takes the time from whoever answers on the network
instead of from named servers. Any machine on the segment can feed it
a false clock. Point the configuration at explicit servers with
"server" lines instead, and turn the broadcast client off.
